      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T18:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t really relevant for graphite today but should compute pipelines use a different pipeline cache strategy? I guess they could have a separate monolithic cache or they can be bucketed on some other attribute.",
      "revId": "a72295c64f6014a4a66c0a7731912c04af8de0e0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4ae43a5b_f96e3cff",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/vulkan/ComputePipelineVk.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 122,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-10T20:11:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we could find another attribute to bucket on later on, but I think in the meantime, using the same monolithic cache should still be a better strategy than the naive implementation we had before.",
